# A Boy's Dream (sandoria 91, PLD AF2): Ailbeche (Northern San d'Oria), Exoroche (Southern, Lua), the Crawlers' Nest
# qm9, Zaldon (Selbina, Lua), the door _6h0 (Chateau d'Oraguille). Exoroche and the door have a default action (76,
# ITS_LOCKED): after each zone-in the first talk plays it and the next his script (the lookup's alternation); those
# talks say "default". Father and Son completed and Sharpening the Sword accepted by GM: Sharpening's 42 (Event) takes
# Ailbeche's first talk after each zone-in and every other talk ("42"), his script (and so the quest's call) the others;
# when the script plays nothing, 42 plays. Sharpening completed and the offer (41 / 40 and their finishes) are #offer's:
# while this quest is available, Sharpening's check 4 then takes his default's talks with AILBECHE_WHEN_FISHING.
# A PLD 50, begun by GM at aBoysDreamCS 2 (as 40 / 41's option 1 leaves it): 46; the bug at CS 2: nothing; Exoroche 50:
# CS 3. The qm9: Dreadbug pops claimed, SENSE_OF_FOREBODING; again the same day: NOTHING_WILL_HAPPEN_YET. Dreadbug
# killed, the Odontotyrannus by GM. Ailbeche at CS 3: 39; the fish at 3, the bug and the fish, two bugs: nothing; one
# bug: 15 (CS 4, the bug kept); the bug at 4: nothing; 60; the fish: 47 (CS 5, the fish kept); the fish at 5: nothing;
# the bug and the fish at 4: nothing; 47 at 5 (no change). Zaldon, the fish: 85 (the Knight's Boots, CS 6, the fish
# taken). Ailbeche 25 (CS 7); 25 at 7 (no change). Exoroche 32 (CS 8), 32 at 8 (no change). The door at CS 8: 88 with a
# full inventory: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED; with room: Under Oath begun (PLD), the boots taken, the Gallant Leggings,
# ITEM_OBTAINED, CS 0, fame 20, completed. Completed: Ailbeche no arm (42), the qm9 NOTHING_WILL_HAPPEN_YET.
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=6.5,0.5,26.9 job=PLD lvl=50
quest Sandoria.FatherAndSon completed
quest Sandoria.SharpeningTheSword accepted
quest Sandoria.ABoysDream accepted
charvar aBoysDreamCS 2
item GiantShellBug x3
login
trigger Ailbeche                        # 42
finish
trigger Ailbeche                        # CS 2: 46
finish
trade Ailbeche GiantShellBug x1         # CS 2, the bug: nothing (CS under 3)
warp 72.0,0.0,60.0 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Exoroche                        # default 76
finish
trigger Exoroche                        # CS 2: 50 (Lua)
finish                                  # aBoysDreamCS 3
warp -25.0,-11.1,122.2 CrawlersNest
trigger qm9                             # accepted, not popped today: Dreadbug spawns claimed; SENSE_OF_FOREBODING
trigger qm9                             # popped today: NOTHING_WILL_HAPPEN_YET
kill DREADBUG
item Odontotyrannus                     # GM: fished
warp 6.5,0.5,26.9 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Ailbeche                        # 42
finish
trigger Ailbeche                        # CS 3: 39
finish
trade Ailbeche Odontotyrannus x1        # CS 3, the fish: nothing
trade Ailbeche GiantShellBug x1 Odontotyrannus x1  # CS 3, the bug and the fish (not exact): nothing
trade Ailbeche GiantShellBug x2         # CS 3, two bugs (not exact): nothing
trade Ailbeche GiantShellBug x1         # CS 3, exactly the bug: 15
finish                                  # aBoysDreamCS 4 (the bug not taken)
trade Ailbeche GiantShellBug x1         # CS 4, the bug: nothing
trigger Ailbeche                        # 42 (the trades leave the turn as it was: read with show)
finish
trigger Ailbeche                        # CS 4: 60
finish
trade Ailbeche GiantShellBug x1 Odontotyrannus x1  # CS 4, the bug and the fish (not exact): nothing
trade Ailbeche Odontotyrannus x1        # CS 4, exactly the fish: 47
finish                                  # aBoysDreamCS 5 (the fish not taken)
trade Ailbeche Odontotyrannus x1        # CS 5, the fish: nothing
trigger Ailbeche                        # 42
finish
trigger Ailbeche                        # CS 5: 47
finish                                  # CS 5: no change
warp -10.5,-7.3,-6.7 Selbina
trade Zaldon Odontotyrannus x1          # CS 5, exactly the fish: 85 (Lua)
finish                                  # the Knight's Boots; aBoysDreamCS 6; the fish taken
warp 6.5,0.5,26.9 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Ailbeche                        # 42
finish
trigger Ailbeche                        # CS 6: 25
finish                                  # aBoysDreamCS 7
trigger Ailbeche                        # 42
finish
trigger Ailbeche                        # CS 7: 25
finish                                  # CS 7: no change
warp 72.0,0.0,60.0 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Exoroche                        # default 76
finish
trigger Exoroche                        # CS 7: 32 (Lua)
finish                                  # aBoysDreamCS 8
trigger Exoroche                        # default 76
finish
trigger Exoroche                        # CS 8: 32
finish                                  # no change
warp -38.0,-4.9,73.5 ChateauDoraguille
trigger _6h0                            # default ITS_LOCKED
trigger _6h0                            # CS 8: 88
fill-inventory
finish                                  # no free slot: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED (Gallant Leggings); nothing else
free-inventory
trigger _6h0                            # default ITS_LOCKED
trigger _6h0                            # CS 8: 88
